{"id":"lm-676c62e2f11f44713bb8a065","title":"A Learnable USA - License Plates","group":"LM North America","desc":"learnablemeta.com map","cards":[{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/DakUuEBSufoFCmcpPJnZ0M7wCpDU0JdZ6J2c.avif"],"a":"Alabama license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Front plates are NOT required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/ENDXBcaIsuCICMF9bFd0hVEWuVVYqh07ZCtR.avif"],"a":"Alaska license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>There are three variants of Alaska license plates.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>A yellow background with black text</li>\n<li>A background that is blue on the top, white in the middle and yellow on the bottom.</li>\n<li>A background that is blue on the top and white on the bottom with a bear in the middle and red text.</li>\n</ol>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/2vGBE1ykk937KoKju9r6lTSL1psdguaqd8nf.avif"],"a":"Arizona license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Front plates are NOT required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/52xdQL0uwvFdsFmRgWJaeCBnFyUnlBNkGSsH.avif"],"a":"Colorado license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Front plates are required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/4N4OEJ24lRZJXIDWmxYqo2DFjbvveiA7vALR.avif"],"a":"Connecticut license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Connecticut license plates are blue on top and fades into white on the bottom. Front plates are required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/klhhPIphBnKM3SfMtCcn7Ix9SyIXgB1hETTN.avif"],"a":"Delaware license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Delaware license plates has gold text on dark blue background, it shows up as a dark blue blur with gold in the middle, and is easy to spot. Front plates are NOT required. <strong>Note: A similar plate can be found in Michigan.</strong></p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/HK8vPyln97aD6J8gBalcyyPhgYF2HcEuvcyu.avif"],"a":"Florida license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Florida license plates has green text on a white background, and it has oranges in the middle, which makes the plate unique. Front plates are NOT required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/4P3q37hZHHVkJyGngHQPakerItsUa2MJiG2s.avif"],"a":"Georgia license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Front plates are NOT required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/5L64WbmlTxDZXXPCndUynSbovrDXMlVWtmEY.avif"],"a":"Hawaii license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Hawaii license plates has black text on a white background. It also has a rainbow in the background that is somtimes more or less visible. Front plates are required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/J5MDMBmHnMjW1ferIWfpFwEFk7kstUWnnPEW.avif"],"a":"Idaho license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Front plates are required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/65FPCYo0W8T5esc62zshKkxMrWkh3BdU3xrr.avif"],"a":"Illinois license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Front plates are required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/wgpQ9i1mUzLqxQgSzx0u7VVZGz8UpCTjCznb.avif"],"a":"Indiana license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Front plates are NOT required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/7GN1w3QSynYNwiogApVqHI8pc14UcSpkkxFM.avif"],"a":"Maryland license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Front plates are required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/yXP9B4r4sNJhVOqxiC4uuKNB9P6bwYlipP5p.avif"],"a":"Massachusetts license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Front plates are required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/KOZyuEyoqRH45ZUAQKQozBWQh0j0izqGByYy.avif"],"a":"Nevada license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Front plates are required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/wJCVHcocYXKNmNtiNCR0Piw3Do26onW1PUcK.avif"],"a":"New Hampshire license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Front plates are required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/PCEBU7n0xfRNhdEz1gXhpvN3aTVIBfKTAlJj.avif"],"a":"New Jersey license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Front plates are required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/Ka56K2f7vsDqaQfHuH19WW8v84zLrsgT0iGg.avif"],"a":"New Mexico license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>New Mexico license plates has red text on yellow background or yellow text on green background, it shows up as a mostly yellow or green blur, and is easy to spot. Front plates are NOT required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/hDQNmnUvt4ktdM3bdMB0OSdwWUoMDAjzlPUe.avif"],"a":"New York license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Front plates are required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/NgqrnXr1YT4t6KZXy9rWmesXj81tzOEyzerQ.avif"],"a":"North Dakota license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Front plates are required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/3XUXWFaKFd992bhqHosjfunoUMN5f9mD0kMf.avif"],"a":"Oklahoma license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Front plates are NOT required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/JQZ66Jc9sQCX5Y89vqhetQm4bJhFAYXNPnhI.avif"],"a":"Oregon license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Oregon license plates has blue text on white background with a green tree in the middle, it shows up as a green dot in the white/blue blur on the sides. Front plates are required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/SqsWQMP0RVQz86mXV9t12DUA3incGIXzJ4Kd.avif"],"a":"South Dakota license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Front plates are required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/R5xZD2dKdyzdRHOCWtLirqzebilp8yzfMshv.avif"],"a":"Texas license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Front plates are required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/hwQnsn9wPhyf9l7pLR8DFt9WH808GkjZ5PL0.avif"],"a":"Utah license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Front plates are required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/VS0FWJ2qmQhaPIaOpcThVCoZo2mi7wjJY55f.avif"],"a":"Vermont license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Vermont license plates has white text on green background, it shows up as a green blur with white on the sides, and is easy to spot. Front plates are required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/8TxFsrr6PvtAElF5GOXkbFYwaAQ2H3gxXR3i.avif"],"a":"Washington license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Front plates are required.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/55/B0nRE00z5CD5sEW7CiGHKNOOAAQUWn9zSlBK.avif"],"a":"Wyoming license plates","slug":null,"note":"<p>Front plates are required.</p>"}]}